              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱ cu Jɔ-cua ruac mi bum ɛ tet la̱th piny kɛ gaat I-thɛ-rɛl kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Ni ram mi wä jɛ wä di̱l i̱ bɛ rɛk Jɛ-ri-ko ɛmɛ nyɔk kɛ ta̱th, ca kuɛth nhiam Kuɔth Nhial.",
          "type": "text",
